  "content": "<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/880/184/project_banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"809\" height=\"291\"></p>\n<h2>重塑生存：ProjectE 超平坦挑战</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">厌倦了千篇一律的枯燥刷怪？<br><br></span></strong>这个整合包将你投入一个独特的超平坦世界，手中唯一的依靠就是 ProjectE。</p>\n<p><strong>拥抱存在的炼金术：</strong>你的旅程始于一张转化桌，它是将你周围的万物转化为强大魔法货币——EMC（等价交换）的关键。</p>\n<p><strong>解锁万物的潜能：</strong>通过将物品和方块喂给转化桌来学习它们，然后使用 EMC 重新合成这些物品！每一个物品或方块都通向无尽的可能性。</p>\n<p><strong>保留原版内核，增添模组趣味：</strong>虽然 ProjectE 占据主导地位，但经过精心挑选的生活便利类和生物类模组增强了游戏体验，同时没有偏离经典 Minecraft 的感觉。</p>\n<p><strong>接受挑战吗？</strong></p>\n<p>这个创新的整合包为生存模式带来了全新的视角，非常适合寻求新冒险或想要体验与众不同的老玩家。</p>\n<p><strong>衷心感谢那些令人惊叹的模组开发者！<br><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>视频展示：<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1ixyxVp2Mmc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/openblocks-trophies\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenBlocks 奖杯 (by GizmoTheMoonPig)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Teams (Forge) (by FTB)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-quests-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Quests (Forge) (by FTB)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafting-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crafting Tweaks (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-fps-render-distance\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Fps - Render Distance[Forge] (by someaddon)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-essentials\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Essentials (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/netherstar-shard\" rel=\"nofollow\">Netherstar Shard (by DanRobzProbz)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/clumps\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clumps (by Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-expansion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project Expansion (by Donovan_DMC)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks (by YaLTeR)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emiffect-status-effects-emi-plugin\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMIffect (状态效果 EMI 插件) (by fzzyhmstrs)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" rel=\"nofollow\">Collective (by Serilum)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Library (Forge) (by FTB)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin (by squeek502)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tnt-slimes\" rel=\"nofollow\">TNT Slimes (by Mrbysco)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/starter-structure\" rel=\"nofollow\">Starter Structure (by Serilum)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jeitweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEITweaker (by Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/searchables\" rel=\"nofollow\">Searchables (by Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loxis-limited-lives\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loxi's Limited Lives (by LoxiGoose)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ding\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ding (Forge) (by iChun)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/light-overlay\" rel=\"nofollow\">Light Overlay (Rift/Forge/Fabric) (by shedaniel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/controlling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Controlling (by Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi-trades-villager-trading-emi-plugin\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Trades (村民交易 EMI 插件) (by fzzyhmstrs)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cupboard\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cupboard (by someaddon)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/projecte\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProjectE (by SinKillerJ)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entityculling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Culling Fabric/Forge (by tr7zw)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/replanter\" rel=\"nofollow\">Replanter (by Areuthreateningme)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spawncapcontrolutility\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spawncap Control Utility (Forge &amp; Fabric) (by MacTso)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-sorter\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Sorter (by cpw)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric/Forge/NeoForge) (by shedaniel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">CraftTweaker (by Jaredlll08)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trade-cycling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trade Cycling (by henkelmax)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extreme-sound-muffler\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extreme sound muffler - (Neo)Forge (by LeoBeliik)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resourceful Config (by ThatGravyBoat)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ferritecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore ((Neo)Forge) (by malte0811)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yeetusexperimentus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yeetus Experimentus (by Sunekaer)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi-loot\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI Loot (by fzzyhmstrs)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/defaultworldtype\" rel=\"nofollow\">Default World Type [Forge] (by MelanX)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\" rel=\"nofollow\">AttributeFix (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-villager-trades-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Custom Villager Trades (Forge) (by SpaceCat_97)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">PackMenu (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bad-wither-no-cookie-reloaded\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bad Wither No Cookie - Reloaded (by Kreezxil)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-extra-mob-drops\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Extra Mob Drops (by Serilum)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade 🔍 (by Snownee)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastworkbench\" rel=\"nofollow\">FastWorkbench (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/badpackets\" rel=\"nofollow\">bad packets (by badasintended)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corpse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Corpse (by henkelmax)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm (Forge Edition) (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wi-zoom\" rel=\"nofollow\">WI Zoom (by alexander9892)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI) (by mezz)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toast-control\" rel=\"nofollow\">Toast Control (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-trader-announcement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wandering Trader Announcement (by UpcraftLP)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI (by EmilyPloszaj)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Fabric/Forge/NeoForge) (by shedaniel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modernfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModernFix (by embeddedt)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fast-leaf-decay\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fast Leaf Decay (by olafskiii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/placebo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Placebo (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>",
